<title>CHINA: Chuang's Consortium yearly net soars.</title>
<headline>Chuang's Consortium yearly net soars.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   7.93	 vs 0.01</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    2	    vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  31.46 gain vs 25.02 loss</p>
<p>    Net			    84.98	vs 0.113</p>
<p>    Turnover		     674.96     vs 436.24</p>
<p>    Company name		 Chuang's Consortium International</p>
<p>				     Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  Dec 1-3</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   Dec 10</p>
<p>NOTE - Chuang's Consortium is an investment holding company with subsidiaries engaging in property investment and development, and securitites trading.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain on sale of an interest in a subsidiary.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong News Room (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
